sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Source Adapter
    participant C as crawler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant V as Attachment Volume
    participant N as NATS JetStream
    participant I as indexer
    participant O as Ollama

    C->>S: fetch_updates(cursor)
    S-->>C: TenderRecordV1
    C->>DB: UPSERT tender + attachment metadata
    DB-->>C: new / unchanged / changed
    alt new or changed
        C->>V: stream attachments to temp + atomic rename
        C->>DB: COMMIT, index_status=pending
        C->>N: publish tender.changed.v1
        N-->>I: durable delivery
        I->>DB: read tender and attachment metadata
        I->>V: read supported files
        I->>O: batch /api/embed
        O-->>I: vectors[1024]
        I->>DB: replace chunks + indexed_hash in one transaction
        I->>N: ACK after COMMIT
    else unchanged
        C->>DB: update last seen only
    end
